WEBVTT

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.530
Please be my friend.

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.120
Hey!

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.890
He's made another amasogi?

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.620
And I keep telling him not to.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.780
Come on, you created it, 
so you have to send it back.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.630
O-Okay...

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.570
Bye-bye, Mr. Eraser.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.890
That's it! Good boy!

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:44.640
These are... my memories.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.660
That's right. Mom was a malison exorcist.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.080
A really strong one.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.480
I wonder why she died.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:06.180
Actually... I had forgotten everything
about her, not just how she died.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.140
Because that's the point of the seal.

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:10.670
Seal?

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.670
Yes. It's almost gone, though.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.090
But why?

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:20.190
Wait... Aren't you the exorcist 
who came before me?

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.850
But the exorcist before me was Mom... so...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.240
Huh?

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.810
You need to get ready, Kazuya.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:33.280
It won't be long now. 
I'm looking forward to it.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.200
Hey, wait!

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.040
What won't be long?

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.240
Bring more pudding...

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.960
<b>Malison Crossing.</b>

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.380
<b>The ability to travel through malison,</b>

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:08.200
<b>with the destination being limited 
to the location of the other Azami.</b>

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:32.050
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.050
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.490
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.490
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.490
<b>Chapter 8</b>

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:43.490
<b>New Club Members</b>

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.890
"New Club Members."

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:50.870
That being the case,

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.590
Mimane and I are going to be working 
with the troubleshooters' office.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:59.690
I realize you don't like the idea of 
us getting near the exorcist, Azami...

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:03.120
But there's something to be gained in knowing

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.360
how they'll react to our 
plans going forward, too.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.140
So, will you allow us do this?

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.330
Azami?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.390
Hey, answer already!

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.610
Wh-What do you want?! If you 
need something, out with it.

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.040
R-Right...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.930
I was asking about us joining 
the troubleshooters' office.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.050
Fine. Do as you will.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.550
But no harm is to come to the exorcist.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.490
If Azami doesn't mind, 
then I suppose it's fine.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.770
Yay!

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:50.360
But that group's advisor is 
the goddess of this region.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:55.380
And our goal is to take her shard.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:59.060
I'm not sure how smart 
it is to get close to her.

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.990
There are risks, but there are also benefits.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:03.960
We'll have to fight the 
exorcist eventually,

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:06.140
and this will let us learn 
about his abilities.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.740
Not only that, but we'll be around when they

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.930
get rid of the aberrations that we caused.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.110
Which means we might be able to hinder them.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.830
You worry too much, Yasuki!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:22.370
Fine. Just be sure to keep an eye out...

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:24.590
for Mimane.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.690
Of course.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.090
Hey, what's that supposed to mean?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.750
Let's head to the club room, Mimane.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.100
Seriously, what's the deal?!

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.110
The situation...

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.110
...hasn't changed.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:49.130
The disruptions in malison are 
starting to weaken the goddess.

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:50.120
And on your end?

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.500
Still asleep.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:54.940
I see.

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:56.870
Wait.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.460
I will.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.630
Troubleshooters'
Office

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.910
I'm Miyou Mimane, a mirror tsugumomo!

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.390
And I'm her partner, Ashimine Akito.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.390
You had a tsugumomo, Ashimine-kun?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.380
You have a sister, don't you?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.650
Y-Yes.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.890
With big boo—

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:31.030
The two of them will take point when 
dealing with amasogi, like Kazuya and me.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:35.880
But we're not suited for combat. 
I don't know if you should expect much.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:39.180
There's actually an aberration 
to deal with right now.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:43.790
So why don't we see what you two can do?

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.050
What is this thing?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.300
A sea urchin?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.970
What's that stinky fruit called?

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.220
Do you mean durians?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.690
Did you do this, Mimane?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.310
Wasn't me!

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:59.850
It must be naturally occurring, then.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:04.250
I think this amasogi may have been created 
out of a desire to withdraw from society.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.320
Then the master is inside it?

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.440
Doesn't seem any amount of 
convincing will work in this case.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.570
Why don't you try and take care of it?

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:15.760
Hey, I have a good idea!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.060
First, I get your whole body 
reflected in the Blood Mirror...

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:23.540
Then I can borrow your appearance and powers!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.840
Uh-huh...

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.080
Blood Mirror: Silhouette!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:30.250
It's Obina Kiriha!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.650
You really are a mirror!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.860
As beautiful as the real deal!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.720
Not just looks, either!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.090
Here we go, Akito!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.850
I see.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.520
In that case... Obi Jab!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.700
Ashimine-kun can use obi techniques?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.850
He must've learned it from 
the battle in the arcade.

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.110
It doesn't seem effective, though.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.120
Very well, we'll teach you a few more.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.420
Spear Weave!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:59.440
Spiral Weave!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.680
Sledgehammer Weave!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.940
Akito, it's not working!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.170
Awfully durable, isn't it?

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.680
They must <i>really</i> not want to go outside.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.390
This calls for boobs.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.200
Was I not hitting you hard enough?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:21.540
No, you've got it all wrong!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.390
I mean like Ama-no-Iwato! The myth!

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:27.590
Ama-no-Uzume did a naked 
dance in front of the cave,

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.890
and then the goddess Amaterasu came out!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.150
Which means she was lured out with boobs!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:36.160
Got it! Here!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.960
Don't use my body for this!

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.810
No response, it seems.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.670
I guess Kiriha-san doesn't have enough volume.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.170
I know!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.800
Wait a sec!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.920
Hey! Put some clothes on!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.170
I'm back!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.920
Blood Mirror: Silhouette!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.180
Ashimine Arumi!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.170
Now these are some honkers!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.930
Mimane!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:06.040
Owie...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.240
Nothing from Arumi, either?

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:11.440
I know! What if the Silhouette and the 
real deal offer a double dose of boobies?

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:15.200
Why don't you get naked yourself?!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.680
If we forget about Shirou's idea, 
I'm not sure what our options are...

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.460
Well, that settles that!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.460
Troublesome as it was...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.850
It didn't play out as I imagined, 
but your powers seem quite handy.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:35.460
We'll be counting on you going forward.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.490
Thank you.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.470
Looks like ya got this one 
wrapped up. Nice work!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.760
<i>The patron deity of Hakusan Shrine, 
Kukuri-hime no Kami!</i>

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.750
Nice to meet ya! I'm yer 
advisor, Shirayama Kukuri!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.100
Ashimine Akito.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.730
I'm Miyou Mimane!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.580
<i>That's the goddess of this region?</i>

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:58.240
<i>She just seems like a little girl...</i>

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.370
So yer Mimane-chan—

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:00.340
Wait, what happened to your clothes?!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.490
Oh, some stuff!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.480
C'mon, girl, ya gotta be more careful!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.360
<i>I barely sense any spiritual force.</i>

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.580
<i>Why even wait at this point?</i>

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:08.000
I guess!

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.930
It's too soon to move on the goddess.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:13.500
She must be weaker.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:16.380
<i>I don't think we can trust Azami...</i>

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:20.890
<i>But we need her powers to contact 
and travel to Mayoiga.</i>

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:20.290
C'mon, cover up yer front!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.420
<i>You understand, don't you, Mimane? 
Choose your words carefully.</i>

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:27.390
Hey, aren't you a goddess, Kukuri?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.650
How'd ya know that?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.650
<i>Mimane!</i>

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.170
So show me your powers! Come on!

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:33.900
Sure thing!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.650
Get a load of this!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.150
The great swell from the 
heavens, Water Impact!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.160
You idiot goddess!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.380
What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>The goddess of this land is taking a 
drubbing from a normal tsugumomo...</i>

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:51.170
Ow, ow, ow!

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:54.200
I see.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.420
The obi techniques of the exorcists, 
and the status of the goddess...

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.680
Looks like we've already made some gains.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.260
Although Mimane's behavior is concerning.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.760
Right. We'll have to warn 
her to be more careful.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.640
Where exactly is she, anyway?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.320
What the?!

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.410
I'm here to spend the night!

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.210
Well, that's abrupt.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:18.570
Well, you see, Akito wants 
to know lots about Kazuya!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.820
About me?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:20.450
Yup!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.220
So let me see your wiener, Kazuya!

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.330
Why?!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.850
It's like an elephant's trunk! Pawoo!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.070
Don't pull on it!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.070
Kinda noisy down there, huh?

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.020
Kukuri-sama...

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.710
I getcha, Kokuyou.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:36.090
It's a regional goddess's job to get 
ridda all the built-up malison...

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.090
Is something the matter?

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:42.130
I think someone crossed 
the field around the town.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.600
Four of 'em... All tsugumomo, too.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.530
Four at once strikes me as odd.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:50.680
True enough.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.440
We oughta hear 'em out, 
since that's the custom.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.960
Can ya go bring 'em over?

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:55.860
Right.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:59.360
Be careful!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.320
It's the goddess!

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.030
What's she doin' here?!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.760
Spending the night, apparently.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.300
Hey, y'know, Kazuya's...

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.870
Don't say anything!

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.740
What's the matter with you, Kazuyan?

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:11.540
Sulk...

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:15.760
Y'know, Kazuya's wiener 
is cuter than Akito's!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.630
It's littler, and has a wrapping on 
top, and is like a little elephant!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.520
I can never go to school again...

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.670
You shouldn't sob over such trivial matters.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.820
Besides, you've had that 
"hood" your entire life.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:30.540
She's right, Kazuyan! 
It ain't all about size!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.680
Not to mention...

00:12:33.110 --> 00:12:34.140
Are you sick?

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.210
Naw, just got a chill from 
bein' out in the night wind.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.900
You should take a bath, too, Kukuri!

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:41.640
W-Wait—

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.660
She's a real bundle of energy.

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.410
Wow, so tiny!

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.940
Cute! So this is what a goddess is like, huh?

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.660
What the heck are you doin'?!

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:53.840
Cut it out! I'm a goddess, 
dang it! And yer club advisor!

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.670
Aw, come on! Let me see better!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.650
What did you do?

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:02.440
Got overheated...

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:08.900
Kokuyou-san?!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:14.940
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:14.940
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.140
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.440
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.440
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.040
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:24.800
Kokuyou...

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:28.200
I performed first aid, but she's hurt badly.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.960
She's all beat up... Who did this?!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.340
What happened out there, Taguri?

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:34.260
Well...

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:35.210
I...

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.570
Kokuyou!

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:38.770
I should explain myself.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:39.910
You oughta lie down!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:43.210
I'm the only one who knows the entire story.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:50.010
I encountered the four tsukumogami 
Kukuri-sama spoke of on the outskirts of town.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:55.510
I serve the goddess of this land, Kamioka.

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:57.140
I would like to know why you are here.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:03.980
We ran away from our tyrannical 
masters, and made our way here.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.970
We'd like to ask for sanctuary 
from this region's goddess.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:12.210
A land's goddess is supposed to offer 
protection to wandering tsukumogami.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.250
We'd like to call upon her kindness.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.700
I understand the situation.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:21.500
However, the four of you all fleeing 
together strikes me as strange.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:25.570
Not only that, but you've come 
this far with little explanation.

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:29.010
Wouldn't it make the most sense 
to turn to your own local god?

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:33.810
If they then send you this way, I will 
gladly introduce you to my mistress.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:39.020
We try to do this the easy way, and the 
goddess's servant starts getting uppity...

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:43.510
If your circumstances are murky enough 
that you would not turn to your own deity,

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:47.530
then I will by no means allow you 
to meet with Kukuri-sama!

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.150
Oh, my. You've really taken a beating.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.970
What a nasty bunch.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.950
This girl is the priestess 
of the regional goddess.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.980
Did you all attack her knowing that?

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.230
If you still want to fight, I'll take you on.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:37.830
Afterward, I brought her here 
while she was unconscious.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:42.010
I'm real sorry, Kokuyou! 
I shouldn't have sent ya by yer lonesome.

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:47.000
No... I'm at fault for letting 
those tsugumomo get the best of me.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:51.030
Why would they have attacked 
Kokuyou-san in the first place?

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:55.920
The fact that they're a group of renegade 
tsukumogami brings a possibility to mind.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.640
Don't you think, Kukuri-chan?

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:00.140
They might be from Mayoiga.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.720
Mayoiga? What's that?

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:03.900
A real long time ago...

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:08.450
A buncha tsukumogami who were 
fed up with bein' exploited by humans

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:12.900
asked their local goddess for 
protection, but were turned away.

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:17.910
They ended up killing her and taking 
the shard that gave her powers.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:23.920
The tsukumogami who led them 
embedded that shard in his chest,

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:29.350
and used the power of the gods to 
create a paradise for tsukumogami

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.440
with no masters: Mayoiga.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:37.420
The residents of Mayoiga are 
still in hiding from the gods,

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.930
so this seems plausible.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.200
Then the four of them...

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.940
Yeah. They're after me.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:49.660
The power they stole from the regional 
goddess ain't gonna last forever.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.950
I figure they were on the 
hunt for a weakened goddess,

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.950
right as the power sustainin' 
them was runnin' out...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.450
So they wanna kill me and take my shard.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:07.450
To be honest, I was followed here.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:13.090
So they're likely to attack this 
place as soon as they've regrouped.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.390
Then I gotta—

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:17.470
What's the point in their target 
waltzing out to greet them?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:24.810
I can take two. That leaves 
two for Kiriha and Kazuya...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.350
That might be a bit too much.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:29.250
Not quite. We've happened 
upon some additional soldiers.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.360
An attack from Mayoiga?!

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.870
<i>Yeah! Here's what they looked like.</i>

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.140
These are...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.110
Genbu, the axe.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.330
Kyouka, the flute.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.160
Senga, the fan.

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.120
And Jungou, the shield.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:53.210
The four of them wanted to attack 
the goddess as soon as possible.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.550
They were agitating for it.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.140
Right. But how did they get out of Mayoiga?

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:02.160
The other Azami wouldn't have just let 
them leave without doing something.

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.800
But she's not here...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.550
<i>Did Azami not notice they left?</i>

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:08.580
<i>Or maybe...</i>

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.570
This might be our chance.

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:16.240
If we work together with them, we can 
defeat the regional goddess, her comrade,

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.170
and the malison exorcists...

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.250
<i>Nope!</i>

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.540
<i>Way too optimistic, Yasuki.</i>

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:22.350
What?

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:27.660
<i>The real reason I came here was to 
ascertain how strong the goddess is.</i>

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.760
And?

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:33.340
<i>Well, as it stands, even all 
eight of us couldn't handle her!</i>

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.530
That can't be!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:38.930
<i>Aw, come on, trust me! 
I've been looking real closely!</i>

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:43.050
<i>So where's your weak spot, Kukuri?</i>

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:44.430
<i>What the heck?! Quit starin'!</i>

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.930
<i>Aw, come on! Tell me!</i>

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.850
I don't think the two of 
you should see any more!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.380
<i>What? But I was just 
getting to the good stuff!</i>

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:54.980
No means no!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:19:00.030
Thanks for coming over, Ashimine-kun.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.780
Mimane told me what's going on.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.860
We'll help however we can.

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:11.190
Y'know, my blood mirror 
can talk to other mirrors!

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.520
That's handy.

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.670
It can show anything I see, too!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:18.420
<i>But I'm a goddess!</i>

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:21.110
Let's be friends!

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.290
Sure!

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.430
Are they actually going to attack?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:30.780
Yes... and they'll want to strike 
before we can strengthen our defenses.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:34.940
One other thing. We should 
take them alive, if we can.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:39.410
I want to make sure any pests buzzing 
around Kukuri-chan are made to suffer.

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.490
And we could also interrogate them, I guess.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.950
Like it's an afterthought?!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.960
Speak of the devil. Here they come.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:55.140
<i>They hurt Kokuyou-san...</i>

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.980
<i>And they want to kill Kukuri-chan.</i>

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.440
Not long after\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Akito and Arumi\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
arrived in Mayoiga...\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.440
<b>Not long after\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Akito and Arumi\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
arrived in Mayoiga...\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h</b>

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:46.150
Come on, let's go to the bath!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.800
No. You're just going to misbehave again.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.550
I will not! I'm just gonna touch your boobs.

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:52.600
I said no!

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.830
But you were going 
"Oh! Oh!" like you liked it!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.460
I was not!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.630
You weren't what?

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.330
Brother!

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:01.580
It's nothing!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:02.850
You two seem to be getting along.

00:22:02.850 --> 00:22:05.090
How can I help you, Chikage-san?

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.260
I brought a futon for you two.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:10.850
Just the one for the two of us?

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.260
We didn't have any more to spare.

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:14.750
Sorry about that!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:15.980
I'm not sure if...

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.690
I could make do with a cushion.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.760
<i>I've been with my brother this 
entire time, but sleeping with him?</i>

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:20.100
You know Arumi-chan would 
feel guilty if you did that!

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:23.060
Well, I'm going to spar with Chikage.

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.610
R-Right!

00:22:26.270 --> 00:22:29.180
<i>I'll be sleeping with him tonight...</i>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:33.480
Brother? You're back early.

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:38.620
We can't! This is too sudden!

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:42.130
I know it was only an oath, 
but we're still siblings...

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.630
Um... Brother...

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:50.160
Just, please, be gentle.

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:52.640
Sure, you got it!

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:54.690
Mimane?

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:55.890
You figured it out?

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:57.680
What are you doing?!

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:01.000
I figured you'd let Akito touch your boobs!

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:02.150
You little—

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:05.150
What's going on? Why the commotion—

00:23:09.730 --> 00:23:13.000
Please wait! There's a 
reasonable explanation!

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.230
<i>Arumi and Mimane's "special relationship."</i>

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:19.410
<i>This misunderstanding wasn't 
cleared up for a while.</i>

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:32.930
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:22.880
Four assailants have arrived in Kamioka.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.550
Faced with powerful tsukumogami, 
we struggle in battle.

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:27.930
But the fighting didn't end there, either.

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:30.220
Even more enemies are after Kukuri-chan!

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:32.930
